---
const response = Array.from({ length: 81 }, (_, i) => {
  const t = 2 + i / 20;
  return `${i ? 'L' : 'M'}${45 + 55 * t},${230 - 160 * (1 - Math.exp(-(t - 2)))}`;
}).join(' ');
---

<figure>
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 440 300"
    role="img"
    aria-label="Força zero até t igual a dois e um depois. A resposta parte de zero nesse instante e aproxima-se de um continuamente."
  >
    <path d="M45 35 V230 H405" class="axis" />
    <path d="M45 70 H375 M155 35 V230" class="guide" />
    <path d="M45 230 H155 M155 70 H375" class="force" />
    <path d={`M45 230 H155 ${response}`} class="response" />
    <circle cx="155" cy="230" r="4" class="point" />
    <text x="25" y="237">
      0
    </text>
    <text x="25" y="77">
      1
    </text>
    <text x="149" y="259">
      2
    </text>
    <text x="369" y="259">
      6
    </text>
    <text x="409" y="237">
      t
    </text>
    <text x="210" y="56">
      força u(t−2)
    </text>
    <text x="210" y="168">
      resposta y(t)
    </text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    Tracejado: força aplicada em t = 2. Contínuo: resposta de y′ + y = u(t−2),
    com y(0) = 0. A força salta; a resposta mantém-se contínua.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  figure {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  path {
    fill: none;
    vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;
  }
  .axis {
    stroke: var(--muted);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .guide {
    stroke: var(--muted);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 2 5;
  }
  .force {
    stroke: var(--text);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-dasharray: 7 5;
  }
  .response {
    stroke: var(--accent);
    stroke-width: 3;
  }
  .point {
    fill: var(--accent);
  }
  text {
    fill: currentColor;
    font-size: 20px;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
</style>
